1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,729 --> 00:00:10,348
Last time, we found
out where notes live.

3
00:00:12,948 --> 00:00:17,381
Today we are going to
meet the music alphabet.

4
00:00:19,681 --> 00:00:25,322
Music has its very own alphabet.
It only has seven letters.

5
00:00:27,422 --> 00:00:28,529
A

6
00:00:28,579 --> 00:00:29,779
B

7
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:31,030
C

8
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,280
D

9
00:00:32,423 --> 00:00:33,498
E

10
00:00:33,548 --> 00:00:34,748
F

11
00:00:34,844 --> 00:00:36,044
G

12
00:00:37,841 --> 00:00:41,252
As we go up, the notes get higher.

13
00:00:41,652 --> 00:00:42,660
A

14
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:43,810
B

15
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:44,960
C

16
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:46,203
D

17
00:00:46,253 --> 00:00:47,228
E

18
00:00:47,278 --> 00:00:48,425
F

19
00:00:48,475 --> 00:00:49,675
G

20
00:00:51,471 --> 00:00:54,976
As we go down, the notes get lower.

21
00:00:55,376 --> 00:00:56,522
G

22
00:00:56,572 --> 00:00:57,719
F

23
00:00:57,769 --> 00:00:58,744
E

24
00:00:58,794 --> 00:00:59,987
D

25
00:01:00,037 --> 00:01:01,137
C

26
00:01:01,187 --> 00:01:02,287
B

27
00:01:02,337 --> 00:01:03,537
A

28
00:01:05,194 --> 00:01:09,535
What comes after G?
There's no H in music!

29
00:01:09,935 --> 00:01:13,068
We go back to A, and start again!

30
00:01:15,468 --> 00:01:19,947
And going down, after A comes G.

31
00:01:22,547 --> 00:01:25,541
Your turn! What comes next?

32
00:01:28,441 --> 00:01:29,641
E

33
00:01:33,966 --> 00:01:35,166
A

34
00:01:39,523 --> 00:01:40,723
G

35
00:01:41,020 --> 00:01:42,341
You've got it!

36
00:01:44,041 --> 00:01:45,502
Now it's your turn!

37
00:01:45,602 --> 00:01:50,314
Ride the Alphabet Elevator,
and see how high you can go!

38
00:01:50,414 --> 00:01:52,804
See you for the next Nugget!

